        ["Which statement about urinary incontinence in older adults is MOST accurate?", ["It is common but not a normal part of aging", "It is normal with age and needs no care", "It only affects women after menopause", "It cannot improve with conservative care"], "Incontinence is common yet treatable; normalizing it delays effective care."]
